     "T3.r2.attr"
    ],
    "scope": "Single-domain Merriwold-Dialog 2.0 test dialogues, JGA per domain, 5 seeds",
    "caveats": "No significance tests reported; small taxi domain (61 dialogues)."
   },
   {
    "finding_id": "F5",
    "summary": "Ablation shows both components contribute to Corvane-DST's JGA: removing slot descriptions reduces JGA from 56.8% to 54.9%, removing history compression reduces it to 55.7%, and removing both reduces it to 53.6%.",
    "evidence_ids": [
